# pip ships its vendored CycloneDX SBOM inside the API image and that SBOM
# still names setuptools 70.3.0, so Trivy reports setuptools advisories against
# the image even though the installed runtime package is newer.
# Verified in the built image with:
#   docker run --rm --entrypoint python sentinova-threatlens-api:verify \
#     -c "import setuptools, pip; print(setuptools.__version__, pip.__version__)"
#   -> setuptools 84.2.1, pip 26.3
# Every entry below is fixed in 84.2.1 except GHSA-xmj3-9gf7-h52w, which is a
# Windows-only path escape and cannot affect these Linux images.
CVE-2025-47273
CVE-2026-59890
GHSA-xmj3-9gf7-h52w
